      "endSeconds": 975.7,
      "audiblePhrase": "Right, Liam Sophie, let's review your prototype. Talk me through it. Of course. Our brief was to design a low-cost water filter for use in rural areas without mains electricity. The main aim was to make it as affordable as possible so anyone could build one.",
